Error: Jet.InvalidUnionMember: `fn(Int) -> Int` can't be a union member
  --> Tests/UI/union_refused_member_is_one_report.jet:3:22
    |
  3 | with_else: fn(value: Int | fn(Int) -> Int) -> Int {
    |                      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Anonymous unions hold concrete closed types — not type parameters, trait objects, or function types
 Fix: Use a named enum when a member needs an open shape
